        "type": "writing",
        "title": "More and more people no longer read newspapers or watch TV programs to get news. They get news about the world through the Internet. Is this a positive or negative development?",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><em>More and more people no longer read newspapers or watch TV programs to get news. They get news about the world through the Internet. Is this a positive or negative development?</em></strong></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Theo Logical Framework &copy;</a></strong></span></h3>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>1.</strong></u><u><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RweDdoI8UomokOxTknVlfh7XgVb\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Đề cho 1 quan điểm:</strong> Ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng c&oacute; nhiều người kh&ocirc;ng c&ograve;n đọc b&aacute;o in hoặc xem c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh truyền h&igrave;nh để lấy tin tức. Thay v&agrave;o đ&oacute;, họ cập nhật tin tức về thế giới th&ocirc;ng qua Internet.</li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một sự ph&aacute;t triển t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework &copy;</strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q17DdVld5ovfxWxIPPjljtuOgte\" data-list=\"bullet\">việc tiếp nhận tin tức qua Internet <em>(Internet-based news consumption)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>2.</strong></u><u><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n body:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework &copy;</strong> với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực hơn l&agrave; ti&ecirc;u cực. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 body như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QXNedvQi4oToyux0vxalTXzBgcd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Body 1:</strong> Ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">mặt ti&ecirc;u cực</span> của việc cập nhật tin tức th&ocirc;ng qua Internet.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TIpOd4794otRJ9x88bWljUqxgUb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Body 2:</strong> Nhấn mạnh c&aacute;c <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">lợi &iacute;ch vượt trội</span> của xu hướng n&agrave;y, khẳng định đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một sự ph&aacute;t triển t&iacute;ch cực.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\">Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework &copy; </strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></u></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></u></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></u></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>3.</strong></u><u><strong> Viết Body 1:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\">Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y c&aacute;c mặt ti&ecirc;u cực của việc cập nhật tin tức th&ocirc;ng qua Internet.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B26bdn7esoz6aRxx9JQlgtuOgtf\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> Phải thừa nhận rằng, việc tiếp nhận tin tức trực tuyến (getting news online) c&oacute; thể tạo ra một số vấn đề li&ecirc;n quan đến chất lượng th&ocirc;ng tin (information quality) v&agrave; trải nghiệm người d&ugrave;ng (user experience).&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mn25dQdBKo78Bqxyr7mlISPwgH9\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQMfdfSq7oxn7Px2e9llfCLdgac\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> C&aacute;c nền tảng mạng x&atilde; hội v&agrave; nhiều nguồn tin trực tuyến kh&aacute;c thường lan truyền&nbsp;<em>c&aacute;c c&acirc;u chuyện chưa được kiểm chứng (unverified stories) </em>một c&aacute;ch nhanh ch&oacute;ng m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng trải qua <em>quy tr&igrave;nh x&aacute;c thực (fact-checking processes)</em> ph&ugrave; hợp.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QWKZdLRRYoFOdnxmq4tl9ANogzG\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Điều n&agrave;y khiến mọi người tin v&agrave;o<em> th&ocirc;ng tin sai lệch (false information) </em>v&agrave; sau đ&oacute; đưa ra c&aacute;c quyết định sai lầm li&ecirc;n quan đến những vấn đề quan trọng như điều trị y tế, lựa chọn ch&iacute;nh trị, hoặc đầu tư t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NGdEdk7WboayNvxbO6zlclP1gl9\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EByTdklwdoXBU0xKSSIlPqeTgdf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Sự phong ph&uacute; qu&aacute; mức (overwhelming abundance) của c&aacute;c nguồn tin tức (news sources) c&oacute; sẵn tr&ecirc;n Internet c&oacute; thể khiến độc giả bị rối loạn đ&aacute;ng kể.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GVJnduZouox0ScxwLLwlJYFtgog\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> Kh&ocirc;ng giống như c&aacute;c<em> phương tiện truyền th&ocirc;ng truyền thống (traditional media) </em>nơi nội dung được<em> bi&ecirc;n tập (curate content)</em>, c&aacute;c nền tảng trực tuyến lại hiển thị v&ocirc; số b&agrave;i b&aacute;o c&ugrave;ng l&uacute;c, khiến người d&ugrave;ng b&igrave;nh thường cực kỳ kh&oacute; <em>ph&acirc;n biệt (distinguish) </em>nguồn tin đ&aacute;ng tin cậy với nguồn tin thiếu ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c, v&agrave; g&acirc;y ra sự nhầm lẫn lớn về th&ocirc;ng tin n&agrave;o c&oacute; thể tin tưởng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>4.</strong></u><u><strong> Viết Body 2:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\">Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về c&aacute;c lợi &iacute;ch vượt trội của việc cập nhật tin tức th&ocirc;ng qua Internet.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W7XNd4x7DokFWsxWtpelDqE1gzt\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, những hạn chế n&agrave;y bị vượt trội bởi c&aacute;c lợi &iacute;ch.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jwp2ddfVKod1DWxSXwClnTdYgAd\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HBfMdTdD9ofszfxVX8SlebZlgbd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Tin tức trực tuyến nh&igrave;n chung c&oacute; chi ph&iacute; hiệu quả hơn nhiều so với c&aacute;c <em>lựa chọn truyền thống (traditional alternatives).&nbsp;</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AA9IdfAdvoUZraxo6Q6lyLVxglg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact: </strong>Trong khi <em>việc đăng k&yacute; b&aacute;o in (newspaper subscriptions) </em>v&agrave; dịch vụ truyền h&igrave;nh c&aacute;p&nbsp; đ&ograve;i hỏi <em>khoản ph&iacute; h&agrave;ng th&aacute;ng đ&aacute;ng kể (substantial monthly fees)</em>, hầu hết <em>c&aacute;c nền tảng tin tức kỹ thuật số (digital news platforms) </em>lại cung cấp quyền truy cập miễn ph&iacute; v&agrave;o nội dung của họ. <em>Sự d&acirc;n chủ h&oacute;a n&agrave;y (democratization) </em>cho ph&eacute;p nhiều người hơn được cập nhật về c&aacute;c sự kiện thời sự bất kể t&igrave;nh trạng kinh tế của họ.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wt5PdhiRqoznJXxMvlblpNmegUe\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ElLtdyEavoANiMxSfMZlBJgzgKh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> <em>C&aacute;c thuật to&aacute;n tr&iacute; tuệ nh&acirc;n tạo ti&ecirc;n tiến (sophisticated AI algorithms) c</em>&oacute; thể ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch sở th&iacute;ch c&aacute; nh&acirc;n v&agrave; <em>th&oacute;i quen duyệt web (browsing patterns) </em>để cung cấp <em>nguồn tin tức được c&aacute; nh&acirc;n h&oacute;a (personalized news feeds) </em>được điều chỉnh ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c theo mối quan t&acirc;m của từng người.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OGwYdf31EoZFuJxC8HFlCyjbgnf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong>&nbsp;<em>Sự c&aacute; nh&acirc;n h&oacute;a (customization) </em>kh&ocirc;ng chỉ tiết kiệm thời gian qu&yacute; b&aacute;u bằng c&aacute;ch lọc bỏ những nội dung kh&ocirc;ng li&ecirc;n quan m&agrave; c&ograve;n tăng đ&aacute;ng kể sự gắn kết của mọi người với&nbsp;<em>c&aacute;c vấn đề thời sự (current affairs)</em> v&agrave; khuyến kh&iacute;ch họ trở th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n chủ động hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>5.</strong></u><u><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></u></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing:</strong></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yfb6dNJURoxnBox2iBblLgczg8e\" data-list=\"bullet\">việc tiếp nhận tin tức qua Internet<em> (accessing news through the Internet)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2148,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Opinions are divided on whether the shift from traditional newspapers and television to Internet-based news consumption represents a positive or negative development. Although this trend presents certain disadvantages, I believe the benefits are more significant.</p>",
            "question_id": 18784,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2149,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Admittedly, getting news online could create some problems related to information quality and user experience. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Regarding the former, social media platforms and various online news sources often spread unverified stories rapidly without proper fact-checking processes. This leads people to believe false information and subsequently make wrong decisions about critical issues such as health treatments, political choices, or financial investments.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Moreover, the overwhelming abundance of news sources available on the Internet can confuse readers significantly. Unlike traditional media where editors curate content, online platforms present countless articles simultaneously, making it extremely difficult for ordinary users to distinguish reliable from unreliable sources and causing considerable confusion about what information to trust.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 18784,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2150,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>However, it seems to me that these drawbacks are outweighed by the advantages. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">One significant benefit is that online news is largely cost-effective compared to traditional alternatives. While newspaper subscriptions and cable TV services require substantial monthly fees, most digital news platforms offer free access to their content. This democratization allows more people to stay informed about current events regardless of their economic status. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Another considerable advantage is that sophisticated AI algorithms can analyze individual user preferences and browsing patterns to provide personalized news feeds precisely tailored to each person's interests and concerns. This customization not only saves valuable time by filtering irrelevant content but also significantly increases people's engagement with current affairs and encourages more active citizenship.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 18784,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2151,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In conclusion, while accessing news through the Internet may involve certain problems regarding information reliability and overwhelming choices, I believe its benefits in terms of affordability and personalization are more significant.</p>",
